        <div class="px-6 py-8 sm:p-10 sm:pb-6">
          <div class="grid items-center justify-center w-full grid-cols-1 text-left">
            <div>
              <img alt="Paytronix gift cards" class="text-center" width="176" height="176" src="/assets/shopify/Shopify-GC.svg">
              <h3 class=" text-2xl mt-8 text-white">Issue Personalized Gift Cards to your Customers</h3>
              <p class="mt-2 text-base">99minds enables customers to purchase, send, and customize branded Gift Cards using Paytronix both in-store and online for your restaurant.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
